**/env

# Exclude large runtime-only directories from the build context. The ml_manager
# image now builds with the repo root as its context (so it can COPY both
# ml_manager/ AND GroundingDINO/). Without these excludes, Docker would ship
# ~1 GB of cache + videos to the daemon on every build.
ml_manager/cache
videos
frontend/.dart_tool
frontend/.flutter-plugins*
**/*.apk
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
